<!-- Status-bar icon for reminders: the app mark's three rules (two readings
     of the Mikra and one of the Targum). Android draws it as a white
     silhouette, so a white-filled glyph with no wordmark reads at 24dp. The
     gold of the Targum's rule is lost in white, so its shape sets it apart:
     60% as long and aligned to the right, like the last line of a Hebrew
     paragraph, and not three equal bars, which read as a menu icon
     (DESIGN_SYSTEM.md §7.8). -->
